# School uniforms

[Uniforms]: Schools should require uniforms.
    + [Equality]: Uniforms hide differences in family income.
        - [Brands]: Pupils still show status through shoes and bags.
            + Shoe rules exist in some schools.
    - [Expression]: Uniforms limit how pupils express themselves.
        <+ [Clothes matter]: Clothing is an important form of self-expression.
    <+ [Cost]: Uniforms are cheaper than a changing wardrobe.
	<- [Price data]: Some uniforms cost more than ordinary clothes.
